# LeadFlow AI

A modern Lead Management CRM designed for HSR Motors.

## Objective

Design a desktop-first CRM that helps:

- Sales Team manage leads efficiently
- Business Managers monitor performance through dashboards

## Project Type

UI/UX Product Design Case Study

## Screens

- Lead Listing
- Lead Details
- Lead Management
- Dashboard

## Tools

- Figma
- VS Code
- GitHub

